# Returns one entry per saved waypoint that failed validation for the loaded robot model.
# The waypoints that passed validation are returned by GetWaypoints. The call fails with an
# error message only when the waypoints file cannot be read; no rejections is a success.
---
# The status of the service call and an optional error message
moveit_studio_sdk_msgs/RequestStatus status

# Waypoints in the file that failed validation for the loaded robot model, with the reason for each
moveit_studio_agent_msgs/WaypointRejection[] rejected_waypoints
